OL,3,GNEWSAOil fly-tippers will face
OL,4,Aprosecution, council vows
OL,5,
OL,6,FFly-tippers who left barrels of oil on
OL,7,Fa rural road will face prosecution if
OL,8,Fidentified, confirms a council.
OL,10,FAround 100 drums were dumped on
OL,11,FHollyfast Lane on the outskirts of
OL,12,FCoventry in July.
OL,14,FCouncillor John McNicholas said
OL,15,FCoventry City Council was "seeking to
OL,16,Fprosecute" those responsible for the
OL,17,Fincident, which he described as
OL,18,F"industrial pollution" and one of the
OL,19,Fworst of its kind seen locally.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
